DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/data_classes/{data_class_id}
Deletes a data class from the account.
Required: account_id (path); data_class_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/data_classes/{data_class_id}
Gets the configuration for a data class.
Required: account_id (path); data_class_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/data_classes/{data_class_id}
Updates the configuration for a data class.
Required: account_id (path); data_class_id (path); body (body) — Attributes of the data class to update.
